msgctxt "108"
msgid "Here we are."
msgstr "Eccoci."

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Great, just gimme a sec!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "All settled, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "(Looks like we're done with the shopping leg of the trip. What now?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "(Guess I could hang out with Rikiya some more.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Rikiya, you have anywhere else you want to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Hell yeah I do! Get me on the roof of that monstrosity over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Huh? The Millennium Tower?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"That's gotta be like, the tallest building in the world, right? I wanna see "
"how Tokyo looks from up there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "...I'm not sure we can do that. The cops are all over the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "...Guess they would be, huh. No surprise after what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"...Sorry 'bout all this, Aniki. I got so caught up in my own\r\n"
"hype that I never stopped n' thought about what you were\r\n"
"goin' through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "It's okay, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Hey, why don't we go someplace quieter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Hm? Why?"
msgstr "Hm? Perché?"

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Well I mean, I never met this Kashiwagi-san personally, but\r\n"
"he was real important to you... Right, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Then it's settled. Anyone who's important in your eyes is\r\n"
"important in my eyes, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"C'mon, I grabbed some beer over at Don Quijote. Why don't we\r\n"
"sit down, crack 'em open, and pay tribute to Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "How 'bout it, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "...Sure. That sounds nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "(Public Park 3 is a pretty quiet place.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Sorry Rikiya, but I think we're gonna have to go our separate ways for "
"tonight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "What, already? You got somewhere to be, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Sort of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Huh. Well, whatevs! I'm gonna keep scopin' out the town if\r\n"
"you don't mind. Not every day I get to spend time in Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Think you can manage on your own?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Oh, totally! I got a pretty good feel for the layout by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Heh, if you say so. By the way, there's a bar called New\r\n"
"Serena over on Tenkaichi Street that we're gonna be using\r\n"
"as our base of operations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Head there when you're done wandering. And feel free to give\r\n"
"me a call if you have trouble finding it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Will do. Catch ya later, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"By the way, Aniki. Here's a little thank you for showin' me\r\n"
"around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Zero Jewel<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto un <Color:8>Gioiello zero<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "624"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>1-1-1 Card<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto una <Color:8>Carta 1-1-1<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "648"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Silver Plate<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto un <Color:8>Piatto placcato argento<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "672"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Toughness Infinity<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto un <Color:8>Toughness Infinity<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Well, later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Continue Exploring with Rikiya"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Go Your Separate Ways"
msgstr ""

